{"page":455,"verses":[{"verse_key":"38:27","surah":38,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا خَلَقْنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا بَـٰطِلًا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ ظَنُّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ فَوَيْلٌ لِّلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنَ ٱلنَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was not without purpose that We created the heavens and the earth and everything in between. That may be what the disbelievers assume- how they will suffer from the Fire!-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāa","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","en_gloss":"(is) between them","transliteration":"baynahumā","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَـٰطِلًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"without purpose","transliteration":"bāṭilan","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ظَنُّ","en_gloss":"(is the) assumption","transliteration":"ẓannu","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَوَيْلٌۭ","en_gloss":"So woe","transliteration":"fawaylun","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"who disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"38:27"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:27"}]},{"verse_key":"38:28","surah":38,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ نَجْعَلُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ كَٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ أَمْ نَجْعَلُ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ كَٱلْفُجَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but would We treat those who believe and do good deeds and those who spread corruption on earth as equal? Would We treat those who are aware of God and those who recklessly break all bounds in the same way?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَجْعَلُ","en_gloss":"should We treat","transliteration":"najʿalu","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","en_gloss":"like those who spread corruption","transliteration":"kal-muf'sidīna","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نَجْعَلُ","en_gloss":"should We treat","transliteration":"najʿalu","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"the pious","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَٱلْفُجَّارِ","en_gloss":"like the wicked","transliteration":"kal-fujāri","verse_key":"38:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:28"}]},{"verse_key":"38:29","surah":38,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٌ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ إِلَيْكَ مُبَـٰرَكٌ لِّيَدَّبَّرُوٓا۟ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ وَلِيَتَذَكَّرَ أُو۟لُوا۟ ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is a blessed Scripture which We sent down to you [Muhammad], for people to think about its messages, and for those with understanding to take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٌ","en_gloss":"(This is) a Book","transliteration":"kitābun","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We have revealed it","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُبَـٰرَكٌۭ","en_gloss":"blessed","transliteration":"mubārakun","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّيَدَّبَّرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"that they may ponder","transliteration":"liyaddabbarū","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(over) its Verses","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلِيَتَذَكَّرَ","en_gloss":"and may be reminded","transliteration":"waliyatadhakkara","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُو۟لُوا۟","en_gloss":"those of understanding","transliteration":"ulū","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"those of understanding","transliteration":"l-albābi","verse_key":"38:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:29"}]},{"verse_key":"38:30","surah":38,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"وَوَهَبْنَا لِدَاوُۥدَ سُلَيْمَـٰنَ ۚ نِعْمَ ٱلْعَبْدُ ۖ إِنَّهُۥٓ أَوَّابٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave David Solomon. He was an excellent servant who always turned to God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَهَبْنَا","en_gloss":"And We gave","transliteration":"wawahabnā","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِدَاوُۥدَ","en_gloss":"to Dawood","transliteration":"lidāwūda","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سُلَيْمَـٰنَ ۚ","en_gloss":"Sulaiman","transliteration":"sulaymāna","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نِعْمَ","en_gloss":"an excellent","transliteration":"niʿ'ma","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعَبْدُ ۖ","en_gloss":"slave","transliteration":"l-ʿabdu","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, he","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوَّابٌ","en_gloss":"(was) one who repeatedly turned","transliteration":"awwābun","verse_key":"38:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:30"}]},{"verse_key":"38:31","surah":38,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ عُرِضَ عَلَيْهِ بِٱلْعَشِىِّ ٱلصَّـٰفِنَـٰتُ ٱلْجِيَادُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When well-bred light-footed horses were paraded before him near the close of day,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"38:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عُرِضَ","en_gloss":"were displayed","transliteration":"ʿuriḍa","verse_key":"38:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"38:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْعَشِىِّ","en_gloss":"in the afternoon","transliteration":"bil-ʿashiyi","verse_key":"38:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰفِنَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"excellent bred steeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāfinātu","verse_key":"38:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْجِيَادُ","en_gloss":"excellent bred steeds","transliteration":"l-jiyādu","verse_key":"38:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:31"}]},{"verse_key":"38:32","surah":38,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"فَقَالَ إِنِّىٓ أَحْبَبْتُ حُبَّ ٱلْخَيْرِ عَن ذِكْرِ رَبِّى حَتَّىٰ تَوَارَتْ بِٱلْحِجَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"he kept saying, ‘My love of fine things is part of my remembering my Lord!’ until [the horses] disappeared from sight-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And he said","transliteration":"faqāla","verse_key":"38:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"38:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَحْبَبْتُ","en_gloss":"[I] preferred","transliteration":"aḥbabtu","verse_key":"38:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حُبَّ","en_gloss":"(